                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Is AI going to replace marketers?</h3>
                                        <p>No. AI amplifies senior marketers 3-6x while making junior-only marketing teams uncompetitive. Judgment, brand, and strategy remain human.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the highest-ROI marketing AI application?</h3>
                                        <p>Creative generation at scale for paid ads. 15-40% CVR lift is achievable with proper testing infrastructure.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use Midjourney or Adobe Firefly for creative?</h3>
                                        <p>Midjourney for standalone quality. Adobe Firefly if you're deep in Creative Cloud and need commercial-safe generation.</p>
                                        <h3>Does AI content still work for SEO?</h3>
                                        <p>Poorly. Google penalises low-effort AI content. Human-edited AI-assisted content works fine; pure AI content at scale doesn't.</p>
